  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "intro",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "(I'm not afraid) Yeah",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "(To take a stand) It's been a ride",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "(Everybody) I guess I had to",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "(Come take my hand) Go to that place to get to this one",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "(We'll walk this road together, through the storm) Now some of you",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "(Whatever weather, cold or warm) Might still be in that place",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "(Just lettin' you know that you're not alone) If you're tryna get out",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "(Holla if you feel like you've been down the same road) Just follow me",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "I'll get you there",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "You can try and read my lyrics off of this paper before I lay 'em",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "But you won't take the sting out these words before I say 'em",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "'Cause ain't no way I'ma let you stop me from causin' mayhem",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "When I say I'ma do somethin', I do it",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "I don't give a damn what you think, I'm doin' this for me",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "So fuck the world, feed it beans, it's gassed up if it thinks it's stoppin' me",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "I'ma be what I set out to be, without a doubt, undoubtedly",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "And all those who look down on me, I'm tearin' down your balcony",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "No ifs, ands or buts, don't try to ask him why or how can he",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "From Infinite down to the last Relapse album",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "He's still shittin' whether he's on salary, paid hourly",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Until he bows out or he shits his bowels out of him",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Whichever comes first, for better or worse",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "He's married to the game like a \"Fuck you\" for Christmas, his gift is a curse",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Forget the Earth, he's got the urge to pull his dick from the dirt",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "And fuck the whole universe",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I'm not afraid",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "To take a stand",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Everybody",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Come take my hand",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "We'll walk this road together, through the storm",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Whatever weather, cold or warm",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Just lettin' you know that you're not alone",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Holla if you feel like you've been down the same road",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Okay, quit playin' with the scissors and shit, and cut the crap",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I shouldn't have to rhyme these words in a rhythm for you to know it's a wrap",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "You said you was king, you lied through your teeth",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "For that, fuck your feelings, instead of gettin' crowned, you're gettin' capped",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "And to the fans, I'll never let you down again, I'm back",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "I promise to never go back on that promise",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "In fact, let's be honest",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "That last Relapse CD was \"ehh\"",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Perhaps I ran them accents into the ground",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Relax, I ain't goin' back to that now",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "All I'm tryna say is get back, click-clack-blaow",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "'Cause I ain't playin' around",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "There's a game called circle and I don't know how",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "I'm way too up to back down",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "But I think I'm still tryna figure this crap out",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Thought I had it mapped out, but I guess I didn't, this fuckin' black cloud still follows me around",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "But it's time to exorcise these demons, these motherfuckers are doin' jumpin' jacks now",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_4",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
