          "persona_id": "eminem"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_5",
      "type": "bridge",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "And I just can't keep livin' this way",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "So startin' today",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I'm breakin' out of this cage",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I'm standin' up, I'ma face my demons",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "I'm mannin' up, I'ma hold my ground",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "I've had enough, now I'm so fed up",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Time to put my life back together right now",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_6",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "It was my decision to get clean, I did it for me",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Admittedly I probably did it subliminally for you",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "So I could come back a brand-new me, you helped see me through",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "And don't even realize what you did, believe me, you",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "I've been through the wringer",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "But they can do little to the middle finger",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "I think I got a tear in my eye, I feel like the king of",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "My world, haters can make like bees with no stingers",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "And drop dead: no more beef lingers",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "No more drama from now on, I promise to focus solely on handlin' my responsibilities as a father",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "So I solemnly swear to always treat this roof like my daughters and raise it",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "You couldn't lift a single shingle on it",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "'Cause the way I feel, I'm strong enough to go to the club",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Or the corner pub and lift the whole liquor counter up 'cause I'm raisin' the bar",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "I'd shoot for the moon, but I'm too busy gazin' at stars",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "I feel amazin', and I'm—",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        }
      ]
    },
